The evidence is consistent enough to write up. Product-catalog's process went quiet at the start of the abnormal window, and the errors spread from there.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "product-catalog",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) AS spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='product-catalog' GROUP BY 1", "claim": "product-catalog emits zero spans in the abnormal window, versus 120 in the normal window."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT 'abnormal' AS period, round(avg(value),0) AS avg_rss_bytes, round(max(value),0) AS max_rss_bytes, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='product-catalog' AND metric='container.memory.rss' UNION ALL SELECT 'normal', round(avg(value),0), round(max(value),0), count(*) FROM normal_metrics WHERE service_name='product-catalog' AND metric='container.memory.rss'", "claim": "product-catalog RSS stays near 0.3 MB in abnormal, versus about 12 MB normally; the process is not serving."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 AS p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name LIKE '%ProductCatalogService%' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY n DESC", "claim": "Callers of product-catalog (frontend, recommendation, checkout) record Error on every GetProduct/ListProducts call, failing in under 1 ms."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "product-catalog", "to": "frontend", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name='grpc.oteldemo.ProductCatalogService/GetProduct' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "frontend's GetProduct client calls to product-catalog all return Error (169 in the abnormal window) and none in normal traffic."}]},
    {"from": "product-catalog", "to": "recommendation", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='recommendation' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "recommendation's ListProducts client calls to product-catalog fail 37 times, and its internal get_product_list spans error too."}]},
    {"from": "product-catalog", "to": "checkout", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='checkout' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "checkout's GetProduct calls to product-catalog error, and its PlaceOrder server spans fail 18 times."}]},
    {"from": "recommendation", "to": "frontend", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name='grpc.oteldemo.RecommendationService/ListRecommendations' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "frontend's ListRecommendations calls to recommendation error (33), and GET /api/recommendations fails with them."}]},
    {"from": "checkout", "to": "frontend", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name='grpc.oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "frontend's PlaceOrder calls to checkout error 23 times, surfacing as POST /api/checkout errors."}]},
    {"from": "frontend", "to": "frontend-proxy", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend-proxy' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "frontend-proxy server spans return HTTP 500 (239) in abnormal, versus 6 in normal; user requests fail at the edge."}]}
  ]
}
